    "name": "Ankr Advanced EVM API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Ankr Advanced API (AAPI) provides a specifically-tailored collection of JSON-RPC\nmethods that optimize, index, cache, and store blockchain data across multiple\nEVM-compatible blockchains. The Advanced API exposes three logical groups:\nNFT, Token, and Query.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Ankr\n Email: support@ankr.com",
